      "value": "<p>A lifted square of quarry working floor: graphite chips, dust, three broken wedges and a compacted surface polished by whatever moves across it. The chips sort into two size classes with almost nothing between them, which is taken to mean two operations rather than two tools. Everything in the lot is black, and everything in the lot glitters, and separating one from another under a lamp is the least popular task in the sector. The floor was fresh at every visit and nobody has ever been present on it.</p>",
